Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.04,0:00:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You want to have...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.67,0:00:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,sex for {\i1}five whole days{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.43,0:00:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.43,0:00:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What better way to make use of\Nyour five days of paid vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about stuff\Nlike my needing to eat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.89,0:00:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't be doing it\Nfor the entire five-day period.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.98,0:00:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,For instance, we'd start with...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.61,0:00:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hugging...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.69,0:00:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And simply holding hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.65,0:00:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd spend four days entirely on foreplay\Nbefore saving the main event for the very end!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.99,0:00:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that would make\Nfor a lovely vacation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.95,0:00:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see~
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko, would you... be\Nhappy if I could do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.55,0:00:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then. Let's give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.97,0:00:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
