Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.26,0:01:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Nadeshiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.59,0:01:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You said we were saving\Nthis for the very end!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.68,0:01:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, for today touching\Nbelow the belt is off-limits
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.27,0:01:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm helping myself to\Nyour upper body instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.19,0:01:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko! C'monnnn..!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.19,0:01:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! That's enough for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.49,0:02:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We're saving climax for\Nthe last day, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.53,0:02:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh? But...{\i0}
