Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.04,0:02:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we focus our attentions\Nbelow the belt today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.30,0:02:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.22,0:02:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,For instance...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,the groin...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.22,0:02:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rubbing your lower abdomen...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.47,0:02:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Pressing in teasingly with my fingers...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.44,0:02:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I knew it. Another day where she's\Njust going to work me up...!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.48,0:02:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If it feels this good now,{\i0}
