Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.66,0:02:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.41,0:02:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready for us to begin, Akane?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.33,0:02:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've been so unfulfilled\NI can't even sleep!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.29,0:02:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If I may, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:03:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All that from just one finger?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.93,0:03:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Akane?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.39,0:03:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for making you hold out so long,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.77,0:03:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but I need you to hold still\Nfor just a little bit longer, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.10,0:03:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.44,0:03:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, the slightest stimulation\Ncan cause incredible pleasure, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.78,0:03:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take time for you\Nto get used to it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.12,0:03:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nadeshiko...\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.41,0:03:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nadeshiko!\N- It'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.00,0:03:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.71,0:03:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want you to feel as\Ngood as possible, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.10,0:03:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Akane...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to keep\Nholding back anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.39,0:03:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel free to tell me\Nwhat you'd like me to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.31,0:03:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,M-More...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.11,0:03:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need more!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.15,0:03:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.07,0:04:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I am working from home tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.03,0:04:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so sorry! Did I overdo it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, I'm so happy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.75,0:04:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like I've finally\Nfulfilled my purpose...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.84,0:04:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Like a washing\Nmachine, or a microwave!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.13,0:04:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.55,0:04:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nadeshiko... sure does say very "robot"\Nthings from time to time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I mean, she sure does seem fond of me,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.52,0:04:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but is that just because of\Nher romance-bot programming?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.98,0:04:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I love that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.81,0:04:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep getting\Nto hear you call me by my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.53,0:04:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I hear you say "Nadeshiko,"\Nit makes me feel so good inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.16,0:04:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I got to hear\Nit so many t times today!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.00,0:04:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.66,0:04:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.25,0:04:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't need to overthink things for now.{\i0}
